    "title": "\"Violence Is Never the Answer\": Political Strategists on the Fatal Shooting of Charlie Kirk | NTD",
    "text": "Political strategists Robin Biro and Gerard Filitti join NTD’s Tiffany Meier to discuss how political rhetoric has turned “deadly” after conservative thought leader Charlie Kirk was shot and killed at a campus event at Utah Valley University. Filitti says the attempted assassination of President Donald Trump “should have been a wakeup call” as well as other cases of violence targeting people on both the right and the left leading up to Wednesday’s tragedy. Biro says, “Our neighbors are still our neighbors, despite our political differences.”\n“Violence Is Never the Answer”: Political Strategists on the Fatal Shooting of Charlie Kirk\nAs we reported on earlier, conservative activist Charlie Kirk has been shot and killed at an event in at Utah Valley University.\nBy\n|\nPublished: 9/10/2025, 11:58:02 PM EDT",
